::MODULE{PROVIDER_FACTS|title:浏览器人工核验的官方价与规格 只渲染在对应厂商页}
  [EMPTY] 一次性人工快照已停用 价格与规格只接受自动管线结果

::MODULE{PROVIDER_REFERRALS|title:只在对应厂商页事实块下方渲染一次}
  Vultr | https://www.vultr.com/?ref=7999218 | View Vultr plans via our referral link | This is an affiliate referral link. We may receive a reward if you sign up and meet Vultr's program requirements.

::MODULE{PROVIDER_VERIFICATIONS|title:非自动管线价格的真实读取方式和响应证据}
  [EMPTY] 非自动核验记录已停用

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
  title price currency billing_period renewal resources offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at

::MODULE{RENDER|title:页面渲染规则}
  language | en
  market | United States
  freshness_label | Checked against official provider pages
  max_offers_per_provider | 12
  show_unpriced_sources | false
  legacy_deal_providers | DigitalOcean, Amazon Lightsail, Hostinger
  legacy_deal_expected_count | 28
  legacy_sitemap_expected_count | 43
  merged_deal_redirect_status | 301
  retired_providers | Vultr, Akamai Linode, Hetzner Cloud, Contabo, Namecheap
  retired_provider_status | 410
  affiliate_disclosure | Links may later be replaced with disclosed affiliate links; rankings never depend on commission.

::MODULE{UPDATE|title:更新频率}
  cron | 17 */6 * * *
  timezone | UTC
  source_policy | official public pricing, sitemap, feed, or promotion pages only
  robots_policy | obey robots.txt and do not fetch disallowed paths

::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒标记过期或下架 不许留着冒充有效}
::RULE{affiliate_link 为空⇒使用厂商官方裸链并标记为非联盟链接}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 绕过robots.txt 抓登录内容|scope:permanent}
